{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/(main)/layout,_N_T_/(main)/nosotros/layout,_N_T_/(main)/nosotros/page,_N_T_/nosotros"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/!KG1haW4p","/!KG1haW4p/nosotros/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":32,"slots":{"children":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}}},"routeCache":{"key":"/route-cache/APP_PAGE/188eaa2e05e823905529ba2546d27cb86bce7cc3bdba9e612d0d66576e8ea1cf/$/nosotros","owner":{"kind":"APP_PAGE","sourceRoute":"/(main)/nosotros/page"},"isFallback":false}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"es\" data-scroll-behavior=\"smooth\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/img/imagenesInicio/logoBlanco.webp\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/img/imagenesInicio/grupoViaje6.jpg\" fetchPriority=\"high\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/imagenTeam4.webp\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/imagenTeam2.webp\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/NICOLE.webp\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/ANGEL.webp\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/img/imagenesNosotros/defaultPersona.jpg\" as=\"image\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0fxi_h-xzasxo.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/1qe_p9pb_-6oa.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3piepmm47cc3f.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/1x6obpmlu1_c2.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1-nqmp1rl8kqt.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3dmm3v_fq28gc.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/202m4j7cuyvzq.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3-ry682tkyiqk.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2e4mlvpqg3s7s.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2c4k78crvjpha.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1gtm4hugtscj6.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3hb0e9qj2bo7-.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2gbfj6ye66dty.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css\" as=\"style\"/><title>Inicio | Premium Events</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Premium Events organiza tours de 2 a 4 días en Tarapoto: Lamas, Laguna Azul, Alto Mayo y cataratas de Ahuashiyacu. Recojo del hotel, guía y movilidad incluidos.\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"tours en Tarapoto,paquetes turísticos Tarapoto,tour Laguna Azul,tour Lamas,tour Moyobamba Alto Mayo,catarata Ahuashiyacu,turismo San Martín,Premium Events\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://premiumevents.pe\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Premium Events | Tours en Tarapoto\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Vive Tarapoto con tours de 2 a 4 días: cascadas, lagunas, aguas termales y cultura nativa, con recojo del hotel y guía incluidos.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://premiumevents.pe\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Premium Events\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"es_PE\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://premiumevents.pe/img/imagenesInicio/imagenOg.jpg\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Premium Events - Tours en Tarapoto\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Premium Events | Tours en Tarapoto\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Vive Tarapoto con tours de 2 a 4 días: cascadas, lagunas, aguas termales y cultura nativa, con recojo del hotel y guía incluidos.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://premiumevents.pe/img/imagenesInicio/imagenOg.jpg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"favicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TravelAgency\",\"@id\":\"https://premiumevents.pe/#agency\",\"name\":\"Premium Events\",\"image\":\"https://premiumevents.pe/img/imagenesInicio/imagenOg.jpg\",\"url\":\"https://premiumevents.pe/\",\"logo\":\"https://premiumevents.pe/img/imagenesInicio/logo.webp\",\"description\":\"Premium Events: empresa de tours en Tarapoto con paquetes de 2 a 4 días que incluyen Lamas, Laguna Azul, Alto Mayo y Ahuashiyacu, con recojo del hotel, movilidad turística y guía.\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Calle Capitán Guitierrez Rondón, 196 - Miraflores, Lima, Perú 15074\",\"addressLocality\":\"Miraflores\",\"addressRegion\":\"Lima\",\"postalCode\":\"15074\",\"addressCountry\":\"PE\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":-12.1289221,\"longitude\":-77.0077074},\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"telephone\":\"+51 929 183 224\",\"email\":\"reservas@premiumevents.pe\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"areaServed\":\"PE\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"Spanish\"]},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/p/Premium-Events-In-The-World-61573880621608/\",\"https://www.instagram.com/premium.eventsintheworld/\",\"https://www.tiktok.com/@premiumevents6\"]}</script><header class=\"header header-noTransparent\"><div class=\"header-logo\"><a class=\"header-logo-link\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/img/imagenesInicio/logoBlanco.webp\" alt=\"Logo\" class=\"header-logo-img\"/></a></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"header-mobile-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Abrir menú\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button><nav class=\"header-links \" aria-label=\"Navegación principal\"><a class=\"header-links-item \" href=\"/\"><h4 class=\"header-links-item-text \">Inicio</h4></a><a class=\"header-links-item \" href=\"/tours\"><h4 class=\"header-links-item-text \">Tours</h4></a><a class=\"header-links-item \" href=\"/arma-tu-plan\"><h4 class=\"header-links-item-text \">Arma tu Plan</h4></a></nav><nav class=\"header-mobile-menu \" aria-label=\"Navegación móvil\"><div class=\"header-mobile-item\"><a class=\"header-mobile-item-toggle header-mobile-link-only \" href=\"/\"><span>Inicio</span></a></div><div class=\"header-mobile-item\"><a class=\"header-mobile-item-toggle header-mobile-link-only \" href=\"/tours\"><span>Tours</span></a></div><div class=\"header-mobile-item\"><a class=\"header-mobile-item-toggle header-mobile-link-only \" href=\"/arma-tu-plan\"><span>Arma tu Plan</span></a></div></nav></header><main><div><section class=\"imgWithMessage imgWithMessageAllScreen \"><img src=\"/img/imagenesInicio/grupoViaje6.jpg\" alt=\"Imagen Hero\" class=\"imgWithMessage-img\" loading=\"eager\" fetchPriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\"/><div class=\"imgWithMessage-text\"><h2 class=\"imgWithMessage-text-title\">EXPLORA EL MUNDO \n<span class=\"imgWithMessage-text-title-highligh\">Vive lo Extraordinario</span></h2><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-left \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><p class=\"imgWithMessage-text-underTitle\"></p></div><p class=\"imgWithMessage-text-subtitle\"></p><p class=\"imgWithMessage-text-description\">Viajes grupales exclusivos, experiencias auténticas\ny recuerdos que transforman tu vida</p></div></section><section class=\"teamShowCase \" id=\"#teamShowCaseInicio\"><div class=\"teamShowCase-container\"><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-left \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"teamShowCase-text\"><p class=\"teamShowCase-text-subTitle\">SOBRE NOSOTROS</p><h2 class=\"teamShowCase-text-title\"><span class=\"teamShowCase-text-title-highligh\">ASPEM </span>OPERADORA</h2><div class=\"teamShowCase-text-divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"teamShowCase-text-description\">Es una empresa dedicada a promover experiencias de viaje a nivel internacional, impulsando el turismo a través de programas y circuitos organizados que permiten a los viajeros descubrir nuevos destinos y vivir momentos únicos. Participamos activamente en rutas y eventos turísticos de reconocimiento mundial, acercando a más personas a la aventura de viajar y conocer otras culturas.</p></div></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-right \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"teamShowCase-imgRight\"><img class=\"teamShowCase-imgRight-img\" alt=\"OPERADORA\" src=\"/img/imagenesInicio/imagenOurTeam.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"teamPersonsList \"><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-down \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><h2 class=\"teamPersonsList-title\">CONOCE A NUESTRO EQUIPO</h2></div><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-down \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:0ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><div class=\"teamPersonsList-divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><ul class=\"teamPersonsList-container\"><div class=\"scrollAnimation scrollAnimation-up \" style=\"--animation-displacement:80px;--scroll-delay:200ms;--scroll-duration:1000ms\"><li class=\"teamShowCase-people-imgs